# Testing & quality (Fase 5)

## Tools (lihat `docs/tech-stack.md`)
- **Vitest** — unit di `tests/`: pricing, storage, i18n, sheetBounds/nearestSnap. `npm test`.
- **Playwright** — `playwright.config.js` projects: `mobile-pixel7` / `mobile-iphone13` / `mobile-iphone-se` / `mobile-landscape` + `desktop` (Chromium + viewport); `video: on`; webServer build+preview. `npm run e2e`, `npm run e2e:mobile`. Browser: `npx playwright install chromium` (dokumentasikan di progress).
- **ESLint flat** (`eslint.config.js`) + **Prettier** — `npm run lint` / `npm run format`.
- **@lhci/cli** — `lighthouserc.cjs` form factor **mobile**; `npm run lhci`; Perf ≥ 80, A11y ≥ 90 (hijau penuh = U6).
- **GitHub Actions** — `.github/workflows/ci.yml`: lint → test → build. LHCI manual, bukan wajib GHA.
- Pertahankan `npm run check` (paritas i18n + assert Node) yang sudah ada.

## Aturan
- Jangan menambah Jest, Cypress, atau Storybook.
- Unit test tanpa WebGL berat; mock `localStorage` / pure functions.
- E2E jangan flaky: locator + assert, bukan `sleep` panjang.
- CI merah = jangan bilang task selesai sebelum diperbaiki atau blocker dicatat di `known-issues.md`.
- Mobile+desktop evidence wajib untuk task U2/U5/U6.

## Baseline audit
- 2026-11-04 live alias: Perf 36 / A11y 100 / BP 100 / SEO 100. Landscape canvas 16px. Lihat `docs/mobile-ux-spec.md` current issues.
